<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">With Google's privacy sandbox suite of technologies largely being de-decommissioned (see <a href="https://privacysandbox.com/news/update-on-plans-for-privacy-sandbox-technologies/" rel="nofollow">https://privacysandbox.com/news/update-on-plans-for-privacy-sandbox-technologies/</a>), it makes sense to start removing MDN's coverage of it, and marking impacted features as deprecated.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR updates our <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Privacy/Guides/Third-party_cookies" rel="nofollow">Third-party cookie guide</a> to remove any mention of the privacy sandbox and impacted features. Note that private state tokens are standardized and are being kept.</p>

